<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GRAND SLAM CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GRAND SLAM CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-round results at the $6 million Grand Slam Cup tennis tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Michael Stich (Germany) 6-3 6-3  </p>
<p>Boris Becker (Germany) beat Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) 6-3 6-2  </p>
<p>MaliVai Washington (U.S) beat Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 7-5 6-2</p>
</text>
